WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.050
Nerves carry fast electrical signals; hormones travel slowly in the blood.

2
00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:09.525
The same five steps, with two ways of sending the message.

3
00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:17.207
Nervous system: electrical signals along nerves, in a split second.

4
00:00:20.122 --> 00:00:24.622
Endocrine system: a gland releases a hormone, carried in the blood.
